default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-04T12:46:13Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T14:14:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n\nReproducible in latest (4.6.1) and maybe almost all versions with english to spanish (and others maybe) translation integrated into the engine \n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.6.1\n\n### Issue description\n\nI was working with the Animation Tree Node (used tree root: AnimationNodeBlendTree -Not sure if repeated in other roots-)  on 3d, and when i designated the parameters for a Transition the engine translated Run and Idle from the inspector to \"Ejecutar\" and \"Inactivo\" in the AnimationTree lower panel of godot engine\n\n<img width=\"550\" height=\"583\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16dcd5f3-0b8e-47b6-bfda-4387d3964ce9\" />\n\nNote: My current system is running in Spanish so maybe it is an unexpected issue in the system that translates the UI of godot to the selected lenguage of the system\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1: Create an AnimationTree node on a 3d scene\n\n2: Create a transition node in the AnimationTree\n\n3: Set up parameters in english with the words Run or Idle by parameter (Capital sensitive)\n\nResult: Expected system lenguage translation in the lower panel of the AnimationTree (ONLY IF GODOT LENGUAGE IS NOT SET ON ENGLISH)\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[AnimationTreeBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25741097/AnimationTreeBug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117061/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117061/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}